recreate this Mermaid Diagram as a PNG diagram: Ask flow with gates:
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant W as Web UI
  participant API as API (FastAPI)
  participant POL as Policy
  participant RET as Retrieval
  participant AZS as Azure AI Search
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant VER as Verifier (Azure OpenAI)
  participant EVID as Evidence
  participant TEL as Telemetry

  U->>W: Ask question
  W->>API: POST /v1/ask {question, docs_snapshot_id}
  API->>POL: is_injection_attempt()
  alt injection
    API->>TEL: record_telemetry(refusal)
    API-->>W: refusal_code=INJECTION_DETECTED
  else ok
    API->>RET: hybrid_search()
    alt Azure enabled
      RET->>AZS: search + vectorQueries + semantic rerank
    else Local
      RET->>DB: load_index_records()
      RET->>RET: overlap + cosine + RRF fuse
    end
    API->>API: confidence gate (CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD)
    alt low confidence
      API->>TEL: record_telemetry(refusal)
      API-->>W: refusal_code=LOW_RETRIEVAL_CONFIDENCE
    else candidates
      API->>VER: verify_relevance() (top 3)
      alt all rejected
        API->>TEL: record_telemetry(refusal)
        API-->>W: refusal_code=NO_SUPPORTING_EVIDENCE
      else verified/unverified
        API->>EVID: evidence_grade(...)
        API->>API: strict grade gate
        alt weak evidence (strict)
          API->>TEL: record_telemetry(refusal)
          API-->>W: refusal_code=LOW_RETRIEVAL_CONFIDENCE
        else answer
          API->>TEL: record_telemetry(success)
          API-->>W: answer_text + citations + evidence + debug_candidates
        end
      end
    end
  end
  W-->>U: Render answer/refusal + EvidencePanel

